{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>荷里活動作巨星布斯韋利士（Bruce Willis）2022年因失語症宣布息影，隔年再確診罹患額顳葉失智症（FTD）而他的病情也持續惡化。一名知情人士透露，布斯韋利士並未完全意識到自己病情的嚴重性。</p><p>該名知情人士透露：「他知道自己的生活與以往不同，但並不覺得有那麼大的差別。他不會談論這件事，甚至也沒什麼好抱怨的。他感覺到有些地方不對勁，但無法全面理解。」</p><figure><img alt=\"知情人士透露，布斯韋利士病情加重「已像嬰兒」。（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215377043296256924563.jpeg/ETAY1ygrQymQnec1MEgcWS9iQsFEl6Lw-Ior3fiKK90\"/><figcaption>知情人士透露，布斯韋利士病情加重「已像嬰兒」。（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><p>更多布斯韋利士Bruce Willis的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"傳布斯韋利士病情加重，小女兒Tallulah Willis怒斥爆料人離自己家人遠一點。（IG@buuski）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197156224362090496907614.jpeg/nMiJHLMOsnWkjibWanX1CMI5uIx8i6FisPWGgLD1hoA\"/><figcaption>傳布斯韋利士病情加重，小女兒Tallulah Willis怒斥爆料人離自己家人遠一點。（IG@buuski）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小女兒Tallulah Willis親吻布斯韋利士額頭。（IG@buuski）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197155006948577280290516.jpeg/ozjeD5vyJg94sQiaZ1o_q0MrXZfF7GDoN1yEaDdchGg\"/><figcaption>小女兒Tallulah Willis親吻布斯韋利士額頭。（IG@buuski）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215394018562048764590.jpeg/wjmYVxluXENpQz78TQgLoN3LAnyXWOxPOwNdRjsDXUY\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215396862431232269143.jpeg/SrLTqOrJjtpf_C6FrQwUpUcQHIqG9n8h8OQjw_DkI8M\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215390297952256085139.jpeg/8ihe-2kqTLs18hlMm84u__1syHNa4ZB4R15ZL0deWS8\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215392286183424173945.jpeg/TnMwvYJMfMCEvAT-ckmVPgOKL3Awgya0N60VeDetFXg\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215390335700992067512.jpeg/K0ntWIx5PHbDYszWKhSzZrkS9d58vbSG2aSfrtmkn64\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215392319737856937658.jpeg/TlDL4waI2j66VGJU3Dr9HJeoDMjPA4wW5AosF-QKLBc\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215385755258880645309.jpeg/vCODH4_xPljsx3fJbt-gChfwX71qdmcaRARZk0QEWZM\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215385906253824705832.jpeg/aZcHuEqdnCAaKKTuOqvNyKT3m59aPEEFTcZQik3GUIo\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215387860930560583019.jpeg/1tjMKMyvvEgv_WSjDUTsDQm7Z9Uc__ODHkr6xx5K-sc\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215388204863488329617.jpeg/uOMt2o7_tYV9Jm4Dvs7ZxhIyCdyu0kanOonJNjqJyTY\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215383142076416160297.jpeg/U2ysWixYzz6ZKm_IZ_sTkwFQsqayUF_DWTZRv1k2Ub8\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215383637004288712364.jpeg/dbeZkV40Q36Un3itVkSUmq8o07SGRMHb4o9p6OKPaeg\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215381548109824670219.jpeg/Mj2BoawzdaKhVhsVImsg_NZ-9ie4EEDBCbhyUQm4clE\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215377043296256924563.jpeg/ETAY1ygrQymQnec1MEgcWS9iQsFEl6Lw-Ior3fiKK90\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215378192535552806524.jpeg/Tmer5PoE1XoIqJtyt80wWxOOtyObbqoJOhfh8DoX4fA\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215378834264064270136.jpeg/OHdRc0ldxtHD9BsVFZ-80b_9ecjfMLZVz_JtVM_ybVQ\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215380273041408751430.jpeg/CIx2RFZl7XsiavcYakthOvToxJK-HdUXZGKUvmRilL4\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215376049115136160574.jpeg/A0DRoBnvYA28RGJGklIm6YVu6qx53U7XZ0KSlGdCkpQ\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215380143017984429315.jpeg/hXWnfc0tNVrZMu0Z9kpkk_oSlL8s8Tw7hXkohoV5KIY\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215375986200576730248.jpeg/VaOQH9H5Xb58Rgp0T7hB8Qc-vTjwQkca-ZvjyPmb48g\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230217/703215374551748608315260.jpeg/4QMPnDiy7G8C5P5axX8-iQIj3jfinvPVj9KU-o_SlPo\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（IG@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><p>據知情人士指出，布斯韋利士的性格也經歷了一些劇烈轉變。據說他現在比年輕時要放鬆得多：</p><blockquote><p>有時候他看起來像個對某個物體充滿好奇、正目不轉睛打量著它的嬰兒。</p></blockquote><p>不過這樣的爆料顯然對於布斯韋利士的家屬造成嚴重的困擾，布斯韋利士最小的女兒Tallulah Willis，正對那位私下爆料她父親健康狀況的人喊話，要求對方「離她家人遠一點」。</p><p>Tallulah針對一篇報導中對方稱布魯斯「現在表現得像個嬰兒」。Tallulah在閱讀該篇文章後發文情緒激動。她表示：「這觸動了我的心弦，因為世界各地愛他的人在我分享照片時曾向我表達過，對於發布的內容應該抱持真實且清晰的覺察。」</p><p>她憤怒的說：</p><blockquote><p>所以，那個分享他「現在表現得像個嬰兒」的「朋友』、「家庭成員」或消息人士？這怎麼能被接受？你是誰？請你離我們遠一點！</p></blockquote><figure><img alt=\"延伸閱讀：布斯韋利士愛女浪漫完婚！荷里活群星低調見證「與時間賽跑」親情（Instagram@brucewillisbw）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163511764151701504203597.jpeg/YvUILXGbl0--YxAw8RKlbh_EMH7q6Qs1bUcV321HFd8\"/><figcaption>延伸閱讀：布斯韋利士愛女浪漫完婚！荷里活群星低調見證「與時間賽跑」親情（Instagram@brucewillisbw）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（Bruce Willis）的幼女塔盧拉·韋利士（Tallulah Willis）上周末與伴侶積斯汀·艾斯（Justin Acee）低調完婚。（IG@buuski）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163462195825086464574690.jpeg/37kSHBH62C1N898U-QgODkfSzm8C5FrQue9tXbnvbV0\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（Bruce Willis）的幼女塔盧拉·韋利士（Tallulah Willis）上周末與伴侶積斯汀·艾斯（Justin Acee）低調完婚。（IG@buuski）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（Bruce Willis）的幼女塔盧拉·韋利士（Tallulah Willis）上周末與伴侶積斯汀·艾斯（Justin Acee）低調完婚。（IG@buuski）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163463542947450880952871.jpeg/RKL08VxRLoRjUv41C9pK5IVGgOY75_r4pnfNF6Z3zRc\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（Bruce Willis）的幼女塔盧拉·韋利士（Tallulah Willis）上周末與伴侶積斯汀·艾斯（Justin Acee）低調完婚。（IG@buuski）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"塔盧拉·韋利士與積斯汀·艾斯的婚禮賓客陣容，堪稱近年荷里活難得一見的實力派巨星聚會。（IG@scoutlaruewillis）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163463836087357440340196.png/42319Ss3-6rKEtQOmQehw9Ky6yNe3pidUo3WeFKN1ng\"/><figcaption>塔盧拉·韋利士與積斯汀·艾斯的婚禮賓客陣容，堪稱近年荷里活難得一見的實力派巨星聚會。（IG@scoutlaruewillis）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"眼見父親FTD病情持續惡化，塔盧拉選擇在此刻完婚，而布斯韋利士由家人攙扶出席婚禮的一幕，令全場動容。（IG@justinacee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163481681923936256469501.jpeg/PKDz75BcQh55jqfs3t1AfgVGOdUDLcSM91uyW_dbsls\"/><figcaption>眼見父親FTD病情持續惡化，塔盧拉選擇在此刻完婚，而布斯韋利士由家人攙扶出席婚禮的一幕，令全場動容。（IG@justinacee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"據悉塔盧拉暫未對外公布詳細蜜月安排，現階段首要仍是留家陪伴親人。（IG@justinacee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163478127821721600603817.jpeg/h2em-_QxYpC0zJFfYqTpqihOfS5mDy-Q6dYjR-nWI0c\"/><figcaption>據悉塔盧拉暫未對外公布詳細蜜月安排，現階段首要仍是留家陪伴親人。（IG@justinacee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"玫瑰花瓣映鑽戒，雙手相扣，這場婚禮是布斯韋利士家族苦難裡難得的喜事。（IG@buuski）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163478320583544832163452.jpeg/tNdrakVBxT3rlr_6uwXk4wjIche13MVORSVea0UlXms\"/><figcaption>玫瑰花瓣映鑽戒，雙手相扣，這場婚禮是布斯韋利士家族苦難裡難得的喜事。（IG@buuski）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"布斯韋利士（Bruce Willis）憑《虎膽龍威》（Die Hard）系列及《鬼眼》等經典電影爆紅。（IMDb)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163515270740840448713086.jpeg/7H4FfMZ8zZEhvvHA46oEDVs_757pMWWhVQN_z1UDf88\"/><figcaption>布斯韋利士（Bruce Willis）憑《虎膽龍威》（Die Hard）系列及《鬼眼》等經典電影爆紅。（IMDb)</figcaption></figure><p>布魯斯威利失智4年罕曝光！71歲「被愛女親額頭」最新病況公開</p><p>布魯斯威利罹失智4年罕現身！親送愛女出嫁　婚禮照曝光惹哭全網</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T04:32:10.845139+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1788,"images":32,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:15:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:46:52.209408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T04:25:48.475344+00:00","content_hash":"411b77cd3a543d0d982da4ba8d59a595436ad3ce93105f26e1f9846b38b295de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}